  "releaseNotes": "- Exact file info via a single listing, no GetObject or ListVersions permission needed\n- One-level folder listings with folder prefixes\n- Folder deletes in pages of 1000 keys, failed keys raise an IOException\n- Delete returns false when nothing was found, provider root protected against delete, move and overwrite\n- ReadFileVersionAsync for versioned reads with root-relative paths, ReadFileAsync(versionId, ...) obsolete and kept under the root\n- Update Cloud.File.Storage.Manager.Common 3.0.0 -> 3.1.0",
